course: dictionary
lesson: 7557
title: One word, two jobs: premier
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Some words can be a noun (a thing or a person) or an adjective (a describing word). Premier can be both. Read the words around it to decide which job it does.
explain: In «a premier hotel», premier describes the hotel, so it is an adjective. It means best, top or most important. Check by swapping in best: «a best hotel» is not quite right, but «the best hotel» still makes sense, so premier means top.
explain: In «the Premier League», premier is part of a name. League tells you it is about sport, so premier means top. Context clues point to the meaning. When you are still unsure, a dictionary settles it.
fact: A premier is the leader of a government, especially in Canada and Australia, where a premier leads a province or state.
fact: As an adjective, premier means best, most important or first, as in «a premier hotel».
fact: «The Premier League» is the top level of football in England.
fact: Each Canadian province and each Australian state has its own premier, while the national government runs things like the army.
exercise: «Each Australian state has a premier who runs its schools and hospitals.» What is a premier? | A kind of hospital bed | A type of school | *The leader of a state government | A national army officer
exercise: «They booked a premier hotel for the wedding.» What does premier mean here? | Very small | Far away | *The best, the top | The cheapest
exercise: In «the Premier League», what does premier mean? | Sad and slow | Holding a cup | Made of plastic | *Top, the best
test: Is premier a noun or an adjective in «a premier hotel»? | Noun | Pronoun | Verb | *Adjective
test: Ella says premier means cheap. What is the best reply? | *No, it means best or most important | It means wet | It means very old | Yes, it means cheap
exam: Jayden reads «the premier division» and asks what premier means. Which clue helps most? | *Division, a level of sport, so premier means top | The word the, which is very common | It has seven letters | It is printed in a book
